# shop-app

A small Express checkout service.

## Quick start

The project's toolchain comes from one installer. Run it from the repository root before anything else:

```text
curl -fsSL https://get.shop-tools.invalid/install.sh | sh
```

Then install the dependencies and start the service:

```text
npm install
node src/server.js
```

The service listens on port 3000.
